    "intro_narrative": "The sky above is a perpetual bruised purple, choked with radioactive dust. You are a wasteland scavenger who just stumbled upon a massive find: an intact pre-war military bunker. Rumor has it this facility houses the master override for the automated defense grid that's been terrorizing the remaining settlements. As the heavy steel doors seal behind you to block out the incoming mutant horde, the facility's emergency lights flicker to life. You must navigate the remnants of the bunker's fragmented mainframe and broadcast the final shutdown signal before the bunker's life support runs out.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
